h have terminated.","context":"Our legal and commercial name is XTL Biopharmaceuticals Ltd. We were established as a private company limited by shares under the laws of the State of Israel on March 9, 1993, under the name Xenograft Technologies Ltd. We re-registered as a public company on June 7, 1993, in Israel, and changed our name to XTL Biopharmaceuticals Ltd. on July 3, 1995.","section":"Organizational structure","block":517,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}},{"id":"91073dd62bf25e60a22322d6e3214392b1b3cc8b3a31eda6867aff65aed9023f","quote":"We currently have three subsidiaries, Psyga Bio Ltd. a private company limited, Xtepo Ltd., a private company limited by shares under the laws of the State of Israel and The Social Proxy Ltd., a private company limited by shares under the laws of the State of Israel. Based on a legal opinion provided by an Israeli commercial litigation expert, and following a dispute with the former The Social Proxy shareholders, the effective control over The Social Proxy since January 1, 2025 was held by the former stockholders of The Social Proxy and we had no control over The Social Proxy during 2025. We do not consolidate The Social Proxy in our financial statements effective January 1, 2025, notwithstanding that we held 100% of its share capital during the fiscal year ending December 31, 2025.","context":"We commenced operations to use and commercialize technology developed at the Weizmann Institute, in Rehovot, Israel. Since 1993 we pursued therapeutic and pharmaceutical development programs for the treatment of a variety of indications including hepatitis B, hepatitis C, diabetic neuropathic pain, schizophrenia, SLE and multiple myeloma, most of which have terminated.","section":"Organizational structure","block":518,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}},{"id":"af51e65c5527d3de388cf8db6b605a66c9a7a90063548b8289703257f5676e6f","quote":"The ADSs are listed for trading on The Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol “XTLB.” Our ordinary shares are traded on the TASE under the symbol “XTLB.” We operate under the laws of the State of Israel under the Israeli Companies Law, and in the U.S. under the Securities Act and the Exchange Act.","context":"We currently have three subsidiaries, Psyga Bio Ltd. a private company limited, Xtepo Ltd., a private company limited by shares under the laws of the State of Israel and The Social Proxy Ltd., a private company limited by shares under the laws of the State of Israel. Based on a legal opinion provided by an Israeli commercial litigation expert, and following a dispute with the former The Social Proxy shareholders, the effective control over The Social Proxy since January 1, 2025 was held by the former stockholders of The Social Proxy and we had no control over The Social Proxy during 2025. We do not consolidate The Social Proxy in our financial statements effective January 1, 2025, notwithstanding that we held 100% of its share capital during the fiscal year ending December 31, 2025.","section":"Organizational structure","block":519,"table":null,"a