arate major line of business or geographical area of operations, or is a subsidiary acquired exclusively with a view to resale. Classification as a discontinued operation occurs at the earlier of disposal or when the operation meets the criteria to be classified as held for sale.","context":"j. Discontinued operations:","section":"ITEM 18. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","block":1394,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}},{"id":"23e2db90b0f5be128d291f2175fcc5f03f3a325abf2f178d61dcd609bd95d617","quote":"On August 14, 2024, as part of the Company’s strategy to expand its assets portfolio with high potential assets, the Company completed the acquisition of 100% of the shares of Social Proxy LTD (the “Transaction”), an AI web data company, developing and powering a unique ethical, IP based, proxy and data extraction platform for AI & BI Applications at scale. Social Proxy LTD had two subsidiaries – Social Proxy Inc (a United States company) and Social Proxy LDA (a Portugal company).","context":"b.","section":"ITEM 18. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","block":1457,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}},{"id":"e93cd28e5eb2073f13bb16770fa5e65dc3eff33a46e2cf7ef1de7e1ffe57b393","quote":"Under the purchase price allocation, the Company allocated the purchase price to tangible and identified intangible assets acquired and liabilities.","context":"The Company accounted the acquisition as a Business combination.","section":"ITEM 18. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","block":1467,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":18},"riskFactors":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"12ed52e36e37eeac93dffd6991fb3554b3050da76feef0f1568342a1b540248c","quote":"●Raising additional capital may cause dilution to our existing stockholders, restrict our operations or require us to relinquish rights to our technologies or product candidates.","context":"Risk Factors Summary","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":99,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-073831","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-06-30","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001023549","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1023549/000121390026073831/ea0296095-20f_xtlbio.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c.bin","sha256":"125bb85717e7cca39f2082bb50417924aea7e72858b829acf600d5248b0a8f9c"}},{"id":"f76c01c8206e2ab813c7212e65170bfaca289a34663d665a6a7ab4c1dc3c3274","quote":"●Management has concluded that there is substantial doubt about our ability to continue as a going concern